# Cellular Mode

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root in full and follow it. It is the canonical
entry point: the seven rules, where state lives, and what to load next.

Cell procedures live in `skills/cell/SKILL.md` and `skills/pause/SKILL.md`. Follow
`skills/cell/SKILL.md` at session start or when asked to resume, and
`skills/pause/SKILL.md` on any stop signal.
